Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Dashboard: shops grouped by grade
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The skill grid's shop tabs are now in one row per grade (4th, then 6th),
and the dashboard opens on the first shop of the class's home grade
(the Lemonade Stand for a 4th grade class, the Café for 6th). Class
settings group each grade's "Unlock through" pickers and "Open for
everyone" switches under a grade heading.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014wQFE2KZBjkYxaH2m8t9SR
